Package: mlbr
Type: Package
Title: mlbr: Modern Baseball Analytics, Data Lake & Machine Learning Engine
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person(given = "cbwinslow", email = "cbwinslow@localhost", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: cbwinslow [aut, cre]
Maintainer: cbwinslow <cbwinslow@localhost>
Description: Idempotent, rate-limit-aware ingestion of every public baseball
    data source (Statcast per-pitch, Retrosheet per-play via the Chadwick
    GitHub mirror, FanGraphs, Lahman, Chadwick register, NCAA, MiLB Statcast,
    Baseball-Reference dailies, ESPN, MLB metadata) into a partitioned
    parquet data lake, plus validation utilities. Raw files are always kept
    at the finest available granularity; aggregation happens downstream in R.
